Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.39,0:00:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,YUM! YUM!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.31,0:00:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,YUM! YUM! YUM !YUM! YUM!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.53,0:00:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,YUM!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.44,0:00:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,YUM!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.35,0:00:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you King of Kings?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.91,0:01:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I can read your mind, and I see\Nyou're losing hope, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.37,0:01:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as Esperoba has Ginzo on the\Nfield, I can't play my trap cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.41,0:01:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That means my alligator sword will be\Neasy pickings for this psycho fraud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.29,0:01:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll have to kiss my life points\Nand the Battle City Tournament goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.35,0:01:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to end this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.57,0:01:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll play this, the\Nmagic card Amplifier.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.07,0:01:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'll hardwire it to Jinzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.23,0:01:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,which will immediately boost\Nhis attack power by 500 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.09,0:01:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, with every new turn, Amplifier will\Ncrank up Jinzo's power by 300 more points.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.51,0:01:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.42,0:01:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, my metal monster, send his\Nalligator sword back to the swamp!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.95,0:01:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I foresee the end for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.09,0:02:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think I'm giving up just\Nbecause of Baldi and his tin can hat,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.83,0:02:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,you definitely got another thing\Ncoming, you blue-haired freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.09,0:02:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll crush you even without\Nmy brother's help! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.71,0:02:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.62,0:02:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.89,0:02:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.23,0:02:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Even without us giving him\Nthe info, Esper's winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.61,0:02:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's still faking the ESP\Njust to psych that guy out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.49,0:02:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Esper-Oba's a strong duelist,\Nbut I know Joey can beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.93,0:02:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.84,0:02:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel isn't over yet. Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.21,0:02:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But I predict it will be just\Nas soon as I make my next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.65,0:02:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not just give me\Nyour locator card now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.23,0:02:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad chance, Roba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.65,0:02:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You and your psychic fraud\Nnetwork are about to go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.83,0:02:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.74,0:02:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, come on, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.39,0:02:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Deck, don't fail me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.47,0:02:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my old friend, Baby Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.43,0:02:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's back in business.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.51,0:02:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.42,0:02:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it up, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.35,0:02:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My Jinzo already has 2,900 attack points,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.19,0:03:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,and my cosmic forces tell me he's already\Nstronger than any card in your deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.69,0:03:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, Jinzo's only going\Nto get more powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.89,0:03:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep that in mind\Nas I summon Baby Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.03,0:03:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what you're up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.87,0:03:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the same trick\NWheeler used to defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.03,0:03:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know whether I should attack\Nyour monster or give it a baby bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.65,0:03:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But if that's the best that you've got\Nto face, Jinzo, then you're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.47,0:03:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It may be just a baby now, but it's\Npossible that my dragon's about to grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.31,0:03:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause I summon Time\NWizard. Time Wizard? I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.27,0:03:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna try to age that\Nbaby dragon into an older dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.95,0:03:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.21,0:03:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, my telepathic powers are telling\Nme that that still won't be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.37,0:03:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be a risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.87,0:03:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But if Time Wizard's spinner\Nlands in the right place,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.75,0:03:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,a thousand years will pass,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.17,0:03:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,making my dragon stronger and\Naging his ginzo into scrap metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.55,0:03:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's find out\Nif luck is on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.45,0:04:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.87,0:04:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.29,0:04:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll destroy my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.93,0:04:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.91,0:04:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Time Warp time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.39,0:04:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby Dragon ages a thousand years\Nto reemerge as Thousand Dragons!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.07,0:04:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, here's the part\Nof the plan you missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.47,0:04:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Your metal monster rusting\Ninto a heap of scratch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.23,0:04:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.37,0:04:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's the rust?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.21,0:04:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Some flat dork.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.69,0:04:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.27,0:04:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinso's special armor\Ntook you by surprise?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.81,0:04:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My monster is made of a special dyed\Ntitanium metal that's guaranteed not to age,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.09,0:04:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,rust, or corrode for 10,000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.55,0:04:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Died titanium who?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.65,0:04:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have done your homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.71,0:04:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.87,0:04:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.09,0:04:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You can beat this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.85,0:05:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We both know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.61,0:05:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mine, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.85,0:05:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Jinso, attack his Thousand\NDragon with Cyber Energy Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.47,0:05:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that my dragon's gone,\Nhow long can I hold on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.97,0:05:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.51,0:05:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,With this secret weapon gone,\NJoey's just barely holding on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.73,0:05:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Tristan, you've been awfully quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.65,0:05:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother is still\Nwinning the duel, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.41,0:05:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.32,0:05:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, uh, you see, he's sort\Nof, um, what was the question?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.49,0:05:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's not losing, is he? Um, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.39,0:05:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't be silly. It's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.63,0:05:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just toying with his opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.33,0:05:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.29,0:05:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for letting me\Nknow exactly what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.19,0:05:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tell Serenity that Joey's losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.13,0:05:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll break her heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.97,0:05:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for me to take your temperature.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.85,0:06:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll just step outside and\Ntake in a little fresh air. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.97,0:06:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.45,0:06:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta win, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.11,0:06:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, you're out of the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.75,0:06:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we're all behind\Nyou, especially Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.69,0:06:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, that gives me an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.57,0:06:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks to me like you're doing\Nextremely well, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.85,0:06:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, nurse, can you help\Nme? Of course. The duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.71,0:06:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you take a look at the screen\Nand tell me who's winning right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.37,0:06:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.85,0:06:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your brother's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.87,0:06:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,All that talk about ancient evil\Nforces returning is freaking me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.37,0:06:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess who?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.43,0:06:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you scared me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.59,0:06:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I scared you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.93,0:06:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That noggin of yours\Nalmost broke my schnoz!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.83,0:06:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, don't sneak up on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.71,0:06:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.25,0:06:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.03,0:06:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey-ya, Tristan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.29,0:06:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you watching Joey's duel right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.01,0:07:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.35,0:07:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.25,0:07:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.16,0:07:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to give him this message.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.83,0:07:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Battle City days are over, Wheeler!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.59,0:07:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dragon is destroyed, and according\Nto the celestial forces that tell me all,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.45,0:07:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,you have nothing in your\Nhand that can defeat Jinzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.59,0:07:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Your future looks dim!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.45,0:07:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I have my deck, I have hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.97,0:07:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't let me down at Duel's\NKingdom, and it won't let me down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.79,0:07:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate the Magic Card Scapegoat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.51,0:07:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your best move?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.95,0:07:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Those hairballs can't\Nsave your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.43,0:07:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinzo will take them out one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.29,0:07:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he'll destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.97,0:07:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you make it easier on yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.91,0:07:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler, and just hand\Nme your locator card?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.51,0:07:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Or you can just continue to embarrass\Nyourself by playing lame cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.73,0:07:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The little creep's right, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.71,0:07:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel's as good as over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.25,0:07:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.41,0:07:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I couldn't defeat his Jinzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.55,0:07:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your move, Groba.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.43,0:08:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I warn ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.55,0:08:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all finished now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.05,0:08:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll head back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.71,0:08:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan? That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.47,0:08:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet you're wanting a duel update, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.53,0:08:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's probably still\Nstringing that guy along.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.69,0:08:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.91,0:08:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Tristan, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.79,0:08:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But you don't have to\Ncontinue lying to me. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.03,0:08:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked the nurse to tell\Nme what's been going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.39,0:08:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Joey's been losing\Nthis duel the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.51,0:08:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.79,0:08:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I just didn't want you to be\Nworried about Joey, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.57,0:08:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.65,0:08:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have to know the\Ntruth about my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.59,0:08:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's in some kind of trouble,\NI want to be told about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.19,0:08:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He's always been there for me when I needed\Nhim, and now I need to be there for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.15,0:08:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,On the day of my eye\Nsurgery, I was so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.79,0:08:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't go through with it until\NJoey got there and stood by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.87,0:08:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My big brother's never let me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.47,0:09:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn to do\Nwhatever I can to help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.27,0:09:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.73,0:09:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I may not be next to him, but can you help\Nme be with him in spirit, pretty please?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.21,0:09:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.65,0:09:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's get back to the duel and cheer\Nthat brother of yours till he wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.55,0:09:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.69,0:09:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, tough guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.89,0:09:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.91,0:09:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,you're just prolonging\Nyour defeat wheeler but
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.55,0:09:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,if that's what you want\Nwho am i to stop you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.51,0:09:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,it's my move
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.07,0:09:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,i summon reflex founder to the field
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.51,0:09:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,my new monster is practically\Nattack proof it can
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.51,0:09:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,reflect any of your monster's\Nattacks right back at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.91,0:09:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So even if you did manage\Nto summon a decent monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.09,0:09:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,all of your attacks would\Nbe completely useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.95,0:09:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.71,0:09:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't forget,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.51,0:10:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,with this in every turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.75,0:10:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,amplifier increases Jindal's\Nattack power by another 300 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.57,0:10:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I've got two undefeatable\Nmonsters on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.13,0:10:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, you don't have a chance, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.39,0:10:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Jinzo, attack your scapegoat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.71,0:10:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Reflect founder, it's your turn to attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.15,0:10:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Your future's looking more\Npathetic by the second.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.13,0:10:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Two scapegoats are down, and if my\Nextra sensory perception is right,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.99,0:10:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,the other two will meet the same fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.39,0:10:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I don't mean to\Nlaugh at you, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.95,0:10:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Losing like this must be painful, but\NI'm afraid it's going to get worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.33,0:10:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,By my next turn, I'll have\Nthree monsters on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.43,0:10:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and I predict your life\Npoints will be gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.01,0:10:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pathetic way to end your\NBattle City experience. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.79,0:11:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't even make your\Nway out of the first round!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.91,0:11:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't lose like this,\Nbut what else can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.19,0:11:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Wheeler! Face the facts!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.49,0:11:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,With those cards, your future career as\Na duelist is bleak and getting bleaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.33,0:11:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't listen to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.53,0:11:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.63,0:11:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You can beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.73,0:11:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you hand me\Nyour rare time wizard now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.75,0:11:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.63,0:11:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe this guy's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.45,0:11:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I've played my best cards,\Nand they weren't good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.39,0:11:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If I lose, he gets my only\Nlocator card and my time wizard,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.15,0:11:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'll be out of the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.63,0:11:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.99,0:11:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, hang in there. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.81,0:11:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Hey, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.73,0:11:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.15,0:11:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan called from the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.51,0:11:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He's watching the duel on the\Ninternet right now with Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.05,0:11:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Your sister wants you\Nto know something, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.11,0:11:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.43,0:12:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.73,0:12:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You two are a team. Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.55,0:12:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And she believes in you, so\Ndon't even think about giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.81,0:12:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm quitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.83,0:12:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity would never give up on me,\Nand I'm not about to give up on myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.93,0:12:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're right here with me, sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.11,0:12:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm gonna win this duel with your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.23,0:12:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This so-called psychic\Nclown is about to go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.33,0:12:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough stalling!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.35,0:12:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna quit or what, Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.15,0:12:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.37,0:12:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.28,0:12:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Suit yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.35,0:12:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.61,0:12:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You can still win this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.23,0:12:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You just have to believe in yourself\Nand in the heart of the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.97,0:12:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.49,0:12:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The odds are against me,\Nbut my friends are with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.97,0:12:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta have faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.13,0:12:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I know there's a card in\Nmy deck that could help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.71,0:12:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,A card that could turn this thing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.97,0:12:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now all I gotta do is draw it so\NI can finish Esperoba. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.43,0:12:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust your deck, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.75,0:13:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Roba, check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.89,0:13:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.80,0:13:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The magic card, Rulet Spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.79,0:13:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Rulet Spider, attach to Jinzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.13,0:13:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.97,0:13:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.88,0:13:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the point of all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.37,0:13:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Playing Roulette Spider is one of\Nthe riskiest moves in Duel Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.73,0:13:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It could destroy me or\Nwin the duel for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.61,0:13:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, after I give up\Nhalf of my life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.13,0:13:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Roulette Spider blindfolds the strongest
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.91,0:13:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,monster on the field and\Nwalks it to the center.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.73,0:13:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where it gets interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.47,0:13:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that web for, Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.61,0:13:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,For a guy with ESP, you\Nask a lot of questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.65,0:13:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the spin table.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.83,0:13:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My spider will spin Ginzo round\Nand round like a giant wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.79,0:13:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,When you tell it to stop,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.31,0:13:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll automatically attack whichever\Ntarget the arrow's pointing to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.47,0:13:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Any target?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.83,0:13:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Open your ears, Psycho Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.93,0:13:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Any target.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.95,0:13:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Could be me, or you directly, or\Nany of the monsters on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.13,0:14:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And since you've been\Nso good about piling up
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.11,0:14:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,attack points for your\Nmonster friend there,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.09,0:14:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,whatever Jinzo points to\Nwill be destroyed instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.45,0:14:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Any predictions, Mr. ESP?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.75,0:14:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.15,0:14:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What's Wheeler thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.49,0:14:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That lame brain's about to risk losing\Nand getting kicked out of the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.23,0:14:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This move will never work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.89,0:14:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.89,0:14:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Roulette Spider! Spin now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.55,0:14:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it points to, it destroys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.13,0:14:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Fraud?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.91,0:14:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You too scared to tell it to stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.97,0:14:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy for him to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.35,0:14:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,With such a lame deck,\Nhe's got nothing to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.81,0:14:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If Jinso points to me, I lose everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.15,0:14:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in you, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.85,0:15:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.27,0:15:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh, Jindo! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.73,0:15:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Jindo's pointing to my Reflect Bounder,\Nand if it attacks, they're both doomed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.47,0:15:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh! Don't reflect!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.65,0:15:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll send his attack right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.27,0:15:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.91,0:15:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If Jizzle's flask is bounced back to it\Nby reflex founder, they're both gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.69,0:15:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late, Rover.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.45,0:15:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Both your monsters are\Ndestroyed and you're history!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.73,0:16:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I had it won!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.47,0:16:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.38,0:16:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,you couldn't beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.57,0:16:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.95,0:16:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me do the math for\Nyou, you psychic sneak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.71,0:16:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinzo started with 3,200 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.19,0:16:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Subtract Reflect Bound to 1,700.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.79,0:16:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And you lose 1,500 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.63,0:16:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.95,0:16:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And his duel is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.15,0:16:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.21,0:16:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.55,0:16:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What an amazing comeback, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.71,0:16:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I just knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.17,0:16:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew he'd win.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.53,0:16:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.65,0:16:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Esper put up an awesome\Nfight, but that guy beat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.65,0:16:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He was so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.01,0:16:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.65,0:16:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Check out the Psychic Duelist now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.13,0:16:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to his ESB?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.55,0:16:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He couldn't predict he'd be a loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.51,0:16:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a tough duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.21,0:17:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now fork over your Jinzo\Nand your Locator card!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.49,0:17:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.40,0:17:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.31,0:17:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't make me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.47,0:17:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You just don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.83,0:17:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you freaking out about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.63,0:17:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stand up and face defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.53,0:17:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, you know the battle city rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.93,0:17:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I get to keep your rarest card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.97,0:17:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone loses once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.07,0:17:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Joey Wheeler blew\Na few duels in his day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.61,0:17:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's not that simple!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.41,0:17:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,People count on me to win, Wheeler!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.87,0:17:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We all have our own reasons for dueling.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.71,0:17:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.65,0:17:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You just don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.31,0:17:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Losing is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.89,0:17:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to win at all costs. I must.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.45,0:17:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not dueling for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.01,0:17:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dueling for my brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.05,0:17:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Brothers?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.99,0:17:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My little brothers look up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.21,0:17:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm like a hero to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.95,0:17:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If my reputation as a loser spreads,\Nthey'll get picked on by bullies again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.59,0:17:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy talk, Roba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.71,0:17:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, this duelist knows a few\Nthings about being a big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.55,0:17:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.73,0:18:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You need a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.55,0:18:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need your pity!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.25,0:18:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, be that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.53,0:18:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, big bro, get up! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.35,0:18:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's that voice coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.97,0:18:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't disappoint us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.51,0:18:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You fought an awesome duel, and\Nyou did it without cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.23,0:18:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're proud of you, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.87,0:18:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But I lost. So?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.67,0:18:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you're not worried about people\Nthinking your big brother is a big loser?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.49,0:18:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No, because in our book, you're a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.05,0:18:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, come here and give your bro a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.79,0:18:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.19,0:18:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I have a lot\Nto learn about winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.95,0:18:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You duel great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.35,0:18:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And the totally best part of\Nit is you did it on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.83,0:18:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, without using any\Nof that phony ESP stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.91,0:18:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So I guess these guys are the\Ncosmic forces he was talking to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.13,0:18:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now all I need is his rare Jinzo\Ncard to finish this happy ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.79,0:19:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.15,0:19:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd find your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.69,0:19:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.60,0:19:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My Jinzo and my Locator card.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.69,0:19:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You deserve them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.73,0:19:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.05,0:19:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm sorry about that cheating thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.53,0:19:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, no worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.15,0:19:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You beat me fair and square, and next\Ntime we duel, I'm playing totally legit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.31,0:19:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No more cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.89,0:19:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hold you to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.59,0:19:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Until then, smell you\Nlater, Robo-Brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.03,0:19:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, we're a lot alike, Esper.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.35,0:19:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.39,0:19:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got your brothers, and\NI've got my sister and my pals,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.47,0:19:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and we're all there to support\Neach other when we need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.61,0:19:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we got that, nobody loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.05,0:19:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.11,0:19:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent dueling, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.57,0:19:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, way to go. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.83,0:20:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey did great today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.49,0:20:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He gets better with every duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.71,0:20:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, my first duel of the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.07,0:20:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And not a bad start,\Nif I do say so myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.65,0:20:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There'll be tough times ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.83,0:20:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know I'm not in this alone.
